{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 32, "model_name": "google/gemma-3n-e4b-it", "content": "Hark a journey to the land of the rising sun a most wondrous quest I shall now weave for thee.\n\n**Day One: Arrival in Tokyo a City of Lights**\n\nFrom distant shores thy vessel doth arrive\nAt Narita's gate where dreams revive.\nA taxi swift shall bear thee to thy keep\nIn Shinjuku's heights where shadows sleep.\nExplore the gardens a tranquil scene\nThen dine on ramen fit for a queen.\n\n**Day Two: Tokyo's Wonders Unfold**\n\nTo Asakusa's temple a sacred place\nWhere ancient spirits find their grace.\nSenso-ji's gate a vibrant hue\nWith market stalls for treasures new.\nThen onward to Shibuya's bustling square\nA human tide beyond compare.\nGinza's shops a glittering sight\nWhere fortunes bloom in day and night.\n\n**Day Three: Hakone's Beauty a Mountain's Kiss**\n\nA journey forth to Hakone's grace\nWhere Mount Fuji smiles with serene face.\nCruise Lake Ashi a waterside dream\nPast volcanic vents a steaming gleam.\nThe Hakone Open-Air Museum's art\nA pleasing balm to soothe the heart.\nReturn to Tokyo as day descends\nWhere evening's charm transcends.\n\n**Day Four: Kyoto's Ancient Heart**\n\nUpon the Shinkansen a speed divine\nTo Kyoto's realm where glories shine.\nFushimi Inari's gates a vermillion maze\nA thousand paths through sunlit haze.\nGion district wander with care\nFor geishas grace beyond compare.\nA traditional tea house a moment still\nWhere ancient customs gently thrill.\n\n**Day Five: Kyoto's Golden Pavilion**\n\nKinkaku-ji's splendor a golden gleam\nReflecting beauty like a waking dream.\nRyoan-ji's garden a mystic art\nZen's quiet wisdom fills the heart.\nArashiyama's bamboo grove so tall\nWhere sunlight dances through them all.\nA temple stay a peaceful night\nBathed in lantern's gentle light.\n\n**Day Six: Nara's Deer and Todai-ji's Might**\n\nTo Nara we journey a joyful ride\nWhere friendly deer roam far and wide.\nTodai-ji Temple houses Buddha grand\nA wondrous sight throughout the land.\nKasuga Taisha's lanterns glow\nA sacred path where spirits flow.\nReturn to Kyoto as twilight nears\nDispelling all thy doubts and fears.\n\n**Day Seven: Departure's Sad Farewell**\n\nA final morn in Kyoto's hold\nMemories made worth more than gold.\nTo Kansai Airport thy spirit flies\nBeneath the vast and endless skies.\nFarewell Japan a land so fair\nUntil we meet again I swear.\n\n\n\n", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.012519695796072483}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -7.152555099310121e-07}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.5660643577575684}, {"token": "▁journey", "logprob": -0.9365425705909729}, {"token": "▁to", "logprob": -0.001122797722928226}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.06851240247488022}, {"token": "▁land", "logprob": -1.5756620168685913}, {"token": "▁of", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": "▁the", "logprob": -0.27448204159736633}, {"token": "▁rising", "logprob": -0.10021068155765533}, {"token": "▁sun", "logprob": -0.00017951308109331876}, {"token": "▁a", "logprob": -0.10320055484771729}, {"token": "▁most", "logprob": -0.12596873939037323}, {"token": "▁wondrous", "logprob": -0.04273255169391632}, {"token": "▁quest", "logprob": -0.31916698813438416}, {"token": "▁I", "logprob": -0.3175652027130127}, {"token": "▁shall", "logprob": -0.006845592986792326}, {"token": "▁now", "logprob": -0.41322681307792664}, {"token": "▁weave", "logprob": -0.3619174063205719}, {"token": "▁for", "logprob": -0.004041955806314945}, {"token": "▁thee", "logprob": -0.0028960451018065214}, {"token": ".", "logprob": -0.11723844707012177}, {"token": "\n\n", "logprob": -0.002003330737352371}, {"token": "**", "logprob": -7.748573807475623e-06}, {"token": "Day", "logprob": -0.0032248892821371555}, {"token": "▁One", "logprob": -0.7065873146057129}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.13456033170223236}, {"token": "▁Arrival", "logprob": -0.00041345154750160873}, {"token": "▁in", "logprob": -0.00017105070583056659}, {"